# Bunny Orchestrator (deprecated)

**Bunny is not a separate orchestrator.** `@bunny`, `/bunny`, and "Bunny, deploy" route through **Sunny** deploy-only mode.

Use **`.cursor/rules/sunny-orchestrator.mdc`** — section **"Deploy-only entry (`@bunny`)"** — and **`.cursor/agents/sunny.md`**. The `bunny.md` agent file is a thin alias for Cursor `@` invocation only.
